    <sys:String x:Key="Protection.Title">Windows enforcement</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Protection.Description">WinDivert intercepts outbound UDP/53 DNS. TCP/53 is blocked rather than proxied when blocking is enabled. Other VPN/filter drivers can run before this layer; compatibility must be tested.</sys:String>
