    <sys:String x:Key="Protection.BlockTcp">Block explicit TCP DNS leaks in the kernel network stack</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Protection.Interval">Enforcement check interval (seconds)</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Protection.Limit">App-owned encrypted DNS is not intercepted. UDP interception ends if the service stops or crashes; there is no persistent UDP kill switch. DNS interception runs in the kernel; encrypted transports and rules run in the Windows service.</sys:String>

